        <description>&lt;img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1704642783129-d50efbdfc037?ixid=M3w0NjAwMjJ8MHwxfHJhbmRvbXx8fHx8fHx8fDE3ODc2NDQ2ODZ8&amp;ixlib=rb-4.1.0" alt="Featured image of post plane" /&gt;&lt;h1 id=&#34;makeplaneplane&#34;&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://github.com/makeplane/plane&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;makeplane/plane&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p align=&#34;center&#34;&gt;
&lt;a href=&#34;https://plane.so&#34;&gt;
  &lt;img src=&#34;https://media.docs.plane.so/logo/plane_github_readme.png&#34; alt=&#34;Plane Logo&#34; width=&#34;400&#34;&gt;
&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p align=&#34;center&#34;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Modern project management for all teams&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p align=&#34;center&#34;&gt;
    &lt;a href=&#34;https://plane.so/&#34;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Website&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/a&gt; •
    &lt;a href=&#34;https://forum.plane.so&#34;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Forum&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/a&gt; •
    &lt;a href=&#34;https://x.com/planepowers&#34;&gt;&lt;b&gt;X&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/a&gt; •
    &lt;a href=&#34;https://docs.plane.so/&#34;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Documentation&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;
    &lt;a href=&#34;https://app.plane.so/#gh-light-mode-only&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34;&gt;
      &lt;img
        src=&#34;https://media.docs.plane.so/GitHub-readme/github-top.webp&#34;
        alt=&#34;Plane Screens&#34;
        width=&#34;100%&#34;
      /&gt;
    &lt;/a&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Meet &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://plane.so/&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;Plane&lt;/a&gt;, an open-source project management tool to track issues, run &lt;del&gt;sprints&lt;/del&gt; cycles, and manage product roadmaps without the chaos of managing the tool itself. 🧘‍♀️&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Plane is evolving every day. Your suggestions, ideas, and reported bugs help us immensely. Do not hesitate to join in the conversation on &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://forum.plane.so&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;Forum&lt;/a&gt; or raise a GitHub issue. We read everything and respond to most.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;-installation&#34;&gt;🚀 Installation
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;Getting started with Plane is simple. Choose the setup that works best for you:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Plane Cloud&lt;/strong&gt;
Sign up for a free account on &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://app.plane.so&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;Plane Cloud&lt;/a&gt;—it&amp;rsquo;s the fastest way to get up and running without worrying about infrastructure.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Self-host Plane&lt;/strong&gt;
Prefer full control over your data and infrastructure? Install and run Plane on your own servers. Follow our detailed &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://developers.plane.so/self-hosting/overview&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;deployment guides&lt;/a&gt; to get started.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;table&gt;
	&lt;thead&gt;
			&lt;tr&gt;
					&lt;th&gt;Installation methods&lt;/th&gt;
					&lt;th&gt;Docs link&lt;/th&gt;
			&lt;/tr&gt;
	&lt;/thead&gt;
	&lt;tbody&gt;
			&lt;tr&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;Docker&lt;/td&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://developers.plane.so/self-hosting/methods/docker-compose&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;&lt;img src=&#34;https://img.shields.io/badge/docker-%230db7ed.svg?style=for-the-badge&amp;amp;logo=docker&amp;amp;logoColor=white&#34;
	
	
	
	loading=&#34;lazy&#34;
	
		alt=&#34;Docker&#34;
	
	
&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
			&lt;/tr&gt;
